<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105050" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῖμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is rubbed</i>:
			metaph., 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβων</span>
			 (B) <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i>a practised knave,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				260
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				431
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a drink</i> or <i>brew prepared of pounded groats and spices,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.Com.
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Axionic.
				4.8
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριμμάτων πλῆθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diocl.Fr.
					138
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως λαβὼν παρ ἐμοῦ . . σησάμου
					τέταρτον τρίψῃ μοι . . τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>UPZ</u>
					62.21
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρωματίζον τόμα ἐν γάμοις
					πινόμενον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fragments,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1672.303
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρινματα</span> lapis), cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.3073.165
			</span></i> (Lebad., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); <i>scrapings,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>abrasion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.181
			</span></i>.</div>
